      "content": "i feel like i'm just sitting in a room that keeps getting smaller every day. i thought being alone would make everything easier, you know? like i could finally just... be. but it's just loud in here. the silence is so heavy i can't even breathe sometimes. i've built this life where no one can hurt me, but now i'm just trapped in it. there's no way out.",
